# Large, fully regenerable artifacts.
# Every one of them is covered by a SHA-256 in output/SHA256SUMS.txt and in the
# per-category manifests, and regenerating the deterministic pipeline reproduces
# those digests bit for bit (verified: STREAMS IDENTICAL ACROSS TWO INDEPENDENT RUNS).
output/streams/*.bin
output/nist_input/
input/images_512/*.png
__pycache__/
*.pyc
output/categories/*/raw_report_manifest.csv.tmp
